{
  "id": "section-947",
  "title": "关于不要“开快车”的指示",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-327.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>327)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　开快车要翻车，要打招呼。当前主要搞大联合，三结合，坏人挖出来．牛鬼蛇神挖出来。党组织要恢复，各级党代表大会召开，人民代表大会召开，我看大体要到明年这个时候，大家不要有疲劳的感觉，不要想脱身。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-326.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-328.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
